strawwu-registry-hooks — install pipeline hooks for StrawWU App Registry

Hooks:
  - APT DPkg::Post-Invoke scans /usr/share/applications after package changes
  - Flatpak trigger scans system Flatpak apps after install/update

CLI:
  strawwu-registry-scan [--linux] [--flatpak] [--all] [--dry-run]

See docs/plans/strawwu-app-registry-plan.md
